acceptance_criteria: "The complete official requirement matrix has no unowned, untested, waived-without-expiry, or contradictory row; SDK, stdio, Streamable HTTP, tasks, skills, Apps, security, caching, and deprecation gates pass with proven negative controls; The exact released package and every advertised consumer surface report and execute the same protocol and extension contract; No critical or high MCP security, conformance, drift, release, or compatibility blocker remains open; The milestone evidence cites exact commit, package version, release, workflow runs, test commands, and immutable pm receipts"
goal: Current standards-based pm integration
objective: "Graduate the MCP programme only after interoperable behavior and optional extensions are proven across SDK, transports, packages, and releases"
value: The roadmap distinguishes protocol claims from exact evidence that real hosts can consume
